Description: 
    Contains different methods to generate embeddings like UMAP, tSNE, PHATE, 
    PacMap and diffusion maps. Morever, has methods to generate nearest 
    neighbour graphs and now also some clustering algorithms that are based on 
    embedding methods (EVoC) and more general clustering methods like k-means.
